{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/强化瓦解射击","pageid":8191,"revid":20191,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%BC%BA%E5%8C%96%E7%93%A6%E8%A7%A3%E5%B0%84%E5%87%BB&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%BC%BA%E5%8C%96%E7%93%A6%E8%A7%A3%E5%B0%84%E5%87%BB&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%BC%BA%E5%8C%96%E7%93%A6%E8%A7%A3%E5%B0%84%E5%87%BB&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>强化瓦解射击</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.BC.BA.E5.8C.96.E7.93.A6.E8.A7.A3.E5.B0.84.E5.87.BB\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"强化瓦解射击\"><b>强化瓦解射击</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 审判之光.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/4c/cpekdd641w2yma97w21huk3wyycux5k.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%B9%8B%E5%85%89.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/4c/cpekdd641w2yma97w21huk3wyycux5k.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%AE%A1%E5%88%A4%E4%B9%8B%E5%85%89.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/4c/cpekdd641w2yma97w21huk3wyycux5k.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />强化瓦解射击\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>1次\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-8\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>5横\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理伤害）对目标范围横向5格所有敌人，造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">120%</font>伤害，驱散<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>个增益，施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"×受治疗\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">×受治疗</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦使地形格变为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">圣域</font></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦释放技能后，召唤援军。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-8 5横.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/73/orp1khbjappghmsrcfne2z1kz4dglmf.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-8_5%E6%A8%AA.png.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/73/orp1khbjappghmsrcfne2z1kz4dglmf.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-8_5%E6%A8%AA.png.jpeg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/73/orp1khbjappghmsrcfne2z1kz4dglmf.png/160px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-8_5%E6%A8%AA.png.jpeg 2x\" data-file-width=\"197\" data-file-height=\"198\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_box\">\n<div class=\"hero_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%83%E7%81%BE%E5%8E%84%E2%80%9C%E6%88%98%E8%BD%A6%E2%80%9D\" title=\"魔物图鉴库/第七灾厄“战车”\"><img alt=\"第七灾厄“战车” 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/de/bwku7gchj1aabegqzy1yel7hrbmzo9w.png/75px-%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%83%E7%81